cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "Calibrated Anomaly Detection on Open UAV Flight Logs: screened corpus manifest, analysis pipeline and derived results"
abstract: >-
  Code, log-ID manifest and derived result tables for a study measuring the
  false alarm rate of the PX4 autopilot's EKF innovation gates on 1,627 real
  quadrotor flights, and evaluating split conformal prediction as a calibrated
  alternative. The raw logs and the Parquet corpus are not redistributed; the
  included fetch-by-ID script rebuilds the corpus from the manifest.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vedantkumarroy/uav-anomaly-detection"
